{"id":"8ea143d97e98d9f3","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-strongly-proper-poset.md","title":"ZFC Strongly Proper Poset","display":"df-zfc-strongly-proper-poset — ZFC Strongly Proper Poset","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-strongly-proper-poset","aliases":["58-df-zfc-strongly-proper-poset"],"display":"df-zfc-strongly-proper-poset — ZFC Strongly Proper Poset","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-proper.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-strongly-proper-poset"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-strongly-proper-poset</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-strongly-proper-poset — ZFC Strongly Proper Poset"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0\" href=\"?note=f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b5833df5ef175153\" href=\"?note=b5833df5ef175153\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-proper.md\">../batch06/58-df-proper.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"faf104362ffe13b3\" href=\"?note=faf104362ffe13b3\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md\">../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\">\\(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\subseteq\\mathbb P^2\">\\(\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\subseteq\\mathbb P^2\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S\\)</span> are the predicates from the displayed dependencies</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> is the ordinal predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HTheta}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{HTheta}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\in}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\in}\\)</span> are defined in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-proper.md\">../batch06/58-df-proper.md</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StrongCompatible}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{StrongCompatible}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StronglyProperPoset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{StronglyProperPoset}_S\\)</span> are the four- and three-place predicates defined below</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}strongly\\text{-}proper\\text{-}compatibility}\\vdash\\mathrm{StrongCompatible}_S(r,d,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow r,d\\in\\mathbb P\\land\\exists s\\in\\mathbb P\\;(s\\leq_{\\mathbb P}r\\land s\\leq_{\\mathbb P}d)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}strongly\\text{-}proper\\text{-}compatibility}\\vdash\\mathrm{StrongCompatible}_S(r,d,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow r,d\\in\\mathbb P\\land\\exists s\\in\\mathbb P\\;(s\\leq_{\\mathbb P}r\\land s\\leq_{\\mathbb P}d)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}strongly\\text{-}proper\\text{-}poset}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{StronglyProperPoset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\\land{}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\exists\\theta_0\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta_0)\\land\\forall\\theta,H,\\mathfrak H,M,\\mathfrak M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\theta_0\\leq\\theta\\land\\mathrm{HTheta}_S(H,\\theta)\\land \\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P}\\in H\n\\land M\\subseteq H\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S(M)\\land\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P}\\in M\n\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak M,M)\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak H,H)\\land\\mathfrak M\\prec_{\\mathcal L_{\\in}}\\mathfrak H\n\\to{}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\forall p\\in M\\cap\\mathbb P\\;\\exists q\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\bigl(\nq\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p\\land\n\\forall D\\;\\bigl(\nD\\subseteq M\\cap\\mathbb P\\land\\forall a\\in M\\cap\\mathbb P\\;\\exists d\\in D\\;(d\\leq_{\\mathbb P}a)\n\\to{}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{13em}\\forall r\\in\\mathbb P\\;(r\\leq_{\\mathbb P}q\\to\n\\exists d\\in D\\;\\mathrm{StrongCompatible}_S(r,d,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}))\n\\bigr)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}strongly\\text{-}proper\\text{-}poset}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{StronglyProperPoset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\\land{}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\exists\\theta_0\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta_0)\\land\\forall\\theta,H,\\mathfrak H,M,\\mathfrak M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\theta_0\\leq\\theta\\land\\mathrm{HTheta}_S(H,\\theta)\\land \\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P}\\in H\n\\land M\\subseteq H\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S(M)\\land\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P}\\in M\n\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak M,M)\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak H,H)\\land\\mathfrak M\\prec_{\\mathcal L_{\\in}}\\mathfrak H\n\\to{}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\forall p\\in M\\cap\\mathbb P\\;\\exists q\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\bigl(\nq\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p\\land\n\\forall D\\;\\bigl(\nD\\subseteq M\\cap\\mathbb P\\land\\forall a\\in M\\cap\\mathbb P\\;\\exists d\\in D\\;(d\\leq_{\\mathbb P}a)\n\\to{}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{13em}\\forall r\\in\\mathbb P\\;(r\\leq_{\\mathbb P}q\\to\n\\exists d\\in D\\;\\mathrm{StrongCompatible}_S(r,d,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}))\n\\bigr)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>对所有充分大的正则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span> 与可数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\prec H_\\theta\">\\(M\\prec H_\\theta\\)</span>，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in M\\cap\\mathbb P\">\\(p\\in M\\cap\\mathbb P\\)</span> 都有加强 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span>，使每个在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\cap\\mathbb P\">\\(M\\cap\\mathbb P\\)</span> 稠密的集合在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 以下预稠密。</li>\n<li>偏序、序关系和顶元均进入谓词参数；相容性也相对于同一序关系展开。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"b5833df5ef175153","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-proper.md","status":"resolved","id":"8935dcac821c0104","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-proper.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md","status":"resolved","id":"faf104362ffe13b3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","locati